        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a juicy brain workout in Fruit Slide! In this addictive tile-sliding puzzle game, your goal is simple—<strong>use your keyboard arrow keys or drag the mouse</strong> to move all tiles at once in any direction (left, right, up, down). Match identical fruit tiles by sliding them together and watch them explode in a splash of fruity fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it’s not just about matching—clever strategy is key! Watch out for special tiles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bomb Tiles</strong> – Instantly destroy the tile they hit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flip Control Tiles</strong> – Reverse your controls on contact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Empty Tiles</strong> – Block movement and add a tricky twist.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your moves carefully, clear the board, and master the fruit-matching mayhem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now available in 24 languages, including:<br>English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Spanish, German, French, Polish, Thai, Bulgarian, Danish, Greek, Italian, Indonesian, Portuguese, Turkish, Czech, Hungarian, Serbian, Hindi, Vietnamese, and Croatian.</p>",
